    "company_description": "Scout Networks serves as the \"A1 partner for all your technology needs,\" acting as a one-stop business solutions provider. From the first connection to everyday support, \"one call brings it all together,\" effectively giving clients one point of contact to handle their entire technological ecosystem.",
