    "differentiation": "Scout Networks takes a unique \"business solutions provider\" approach rather than acting as a traditional MSP. They communicate without technical jargon (\"no geek speak\"), preferring to sit across the table from business owners and relate to their real-world operational and HR challenges. They apply best practices to ensure clients are fully leveraging their technology budgets, gaining the most efficient use out of their systems to actively fuel and protect the business.",
