    "sales_process": "The process is highly \"on-site driven\" (a \"cheeks in the seats\" philosophy). It begins with an initial phone call, quickly followed by an in-person site visit to physically evaluate the environment, assess network/Wi-Fi needs, and check machine security. From there, Scout Networks builds a highly detailed scope of work identifying every element and hour required, culminating in a custom proposal presented to the end user.",
