    "client_frustrations": "Incoming clients are highly frustrated by a lack of communication and agonizingly slow response times from their previous IT providers—sometimes waiting two or three days for help. They recognize that unaddressed downtime directly costs the business owner money, and they are frustrated by providers who do not treat their outages with urgency.",
    "client_outcomes": [
      "Faster response times",
      "Stronger cybersecurity posture",
      "Reliable systems and less downtime"
    ],
    "client_outcomes_other": "",
    "value_description": "Clients frequently describe the team as \"responsive,\" \"knowledgeable,\" \"proactive,\" \"professional,\" and \"flawless\". They refer to Scout Networks as an \"extension of our team\" and a \"valuable resource\" that embraces current technologies to streamline workflows and secure data.",
    "ideal_client": "The ideal client is a business owner looking for ways to spend their technology dollars more efficiently to achieve highly optimal outcomes. They are often organizations with unmanaged or neglected IT environments that need a trusted partner to identify gaps, secure their network, and properly manage their technology footprint.",
